## 📌 Final Recommendations
1. Build depth, not just breadth — pick and master core tools.
2. Focus on **design thinking** and **architecture trade-offs**.
3. Take initiative — lead projects, PoCs, or technical presentations.
4. Maintain a portfolio with **architecture diagrams** and **decision records**.
5. Start preparing for **architecture/system design interviews**.

Final Recommendations
Prioritize value-driven work over just tech

Work on open-source contributions or large internal systems

Build a personal architecture portfolio with diagrams + case studies

Practice mock architecture interviews